        <mxCell id="note" value="Notes: CanonicalTransactionHasher validates and normalizes each transaction (institution | externalId | amount | date | payee) and computes a SHA-256 dedup key. The hash is a permanent contract; INSERT OR IGNORE is the source of truth, so re-downloads never create duplicates. A failing plugin records a failed download run and never stops the other plugins. Payee, amount, external ID, institution, and hash values are never logged." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8C5;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="1185" width="1270" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
